{% comment %}
  Stone Luxe Chino product story. Rendered by sections/guillo-product.liquid
  on that one product only, below the gallery and buy column.

  Kept in its own snippet so the story can be edited without touching the
  130KB product section. Every selector is scoped to .guillo-pdp--stone.

  Order on desktop: video left; story, fit gauges, feature rows and a real
  review on the right. On a phone: gauges, features, story, video, review.
  Then a full-width editorial image with one line of copy.

  Expects: product, section, gstone_video (captured video tile markup).
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign st_story_title = section.settings.stone_story_title | default: 'A sharp fit without the stiff feel'
  assign st_story_text = section.settings.stone_story_text | default: 'Slim and clean through the leg, with stretch where you move. Sharp enough for dinner on a warm evening, easy enough for every day in between.'
-%}

<div class="gstone-band">
  <div class="gstone-band__head">
    <p class="gstone-band__eyebrow">The Luxe Chino in {{ product.handle | remove_first: 'the-luxe-chino-' | replace: '-', ' ' | capitalize }}</p>
    <h2 class="gstone-band__title">{{ st_story_title }}</h2>
    <p class="gstone-band__sub">{{ st_story_text }}</p>
  </div>
  <div class="gstone-band__media">{{ gstone_video }}</div>
  <div class="gstone-band__fit" aria-label="How it fits">
    {%- comment -%}
      Two left to right scales. Positions are percentages along the track.
      Not measurements, just where this cut lands between the two ends.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="gstone-fitbar">
      <div class="gstone-fitbar__row"><span class="gstone-fitbar__name">Fit</span><span class="gstone-fitbar__val">Slim</span></div>
      <div class="gstone-fitbar__track"><span class="gstone-fitbar__dot" style="left: 74%"></span></div>
      <div class="gstone-fitbar__ends"><span>Baggy</span><span>Skinny</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="gstone-fitbar">
      <div class="gstone-fitbar__row"><span class="gstone-fitbar__name">Leg length</span><span class="gstone-fitbar__val">Runs slightly short</span></div>
      <div class="gstone-fitbar__track"><span class="gstone-fitbar__dot" style="left: 38%"></span></div>
      <div class="gstone-fitbar__ends"><span>Runs short</span><span>Runs long</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="gstone-band__feats">
    {%- comment -%}
      One closed row labelled Features, with a down arrow that turns up when
      open. Nothing inside it is visible until it is tapped. Open, it shows
      four features, each an icon, a name and one line of explanation.
      Native <details>, so it is keyboard operable and announces open or
      closed with no script. Icons are the same set the feature blocks in
      sections/guillo-product.liquid use (stretch, taper, breathable, silk).
      Every line is taken from the Fit & Care and Details copy already on
      this page.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <details class="gstone-featgroup">
      <summary class="gstone-featgroup__btn">
        <span class="gstone-featgroup__label">Features</span>
        <span class="gstone-feat__mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></span>
      </summary>
      <div class="gstone-feats">
        <div class="gstone-feat">
          <span class="gstone-feat__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"><path d="M2 12h20"/><path d="M6 8l-4 4 4 4"/><path d="M18 8l4 4-4 4"/></svg></span>
          <div class="gstone-feat__body">
            <p class="gstone-feat__label">Stretch through the waist</p>
            <p class="gstone-feat__text">A stretch waistband that stays comfortable through a full day of sitting, walking and eating. Take your true waist. The twill gives one to two centimetres in the first week of wear.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="gstone-feat">
          <span class="gstone-feat__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"><path d="M6 3h12l-3 18H9L6 3z"/><path d="M8.5 12h7"/></svg></span>
          <div class="gstone-feat__body">
            <p class="gstone-feat__label">Slim, tapered leg</p>
            <p class="gstone-feat__text">Close through the leg with room drafted into the seat and thigh, then a clean taper from the knee to a narrow ankle. No flare at the hem.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="gstone-feat">
          <span class="gstone-feat__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M3 8h9a2.5 2.5 0 1 0-2.5-2.5"/><path d="M3 12h13a2.5 2.5 0 1 1-2.5 2.5"/><path d="M3 16h7a2 2 0 1 1-2 2"/></svg></span>
          <div class="gstone-feat__body">
            <p class="gstone-feat__label">Lightweight and breathable</p>
            <p class="gstone-feat__text">Cotton twill with elastane, finished to resist wrinkles. Light enough for warm weather, with enough structure for evening.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="gstone-feat">
          <span class="gstone-feat__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M3 7c3-2.6 6-2.6 9 0s6 2.6 9 0"/><path d="M3 12c3-2.6 6-2.6 9 0s6 2.6 9 0"/><path d="M3 17c3-2.6 6-2.6 9 0s6 2.6 9 0"/></svg></span>
          <div class="gstone-feat__body">
            <p class="gstone-feat__label">Built to move</p>
            <p class="gstone-feat__text">The fabric moves when you do and recovers on the hanger instead of holding the shape of the chair. Seams are reinforced at every stress point.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
  <div class="gstone-band__voices">
    {%- liquid
      # Up to five real verified reviews from the same Judge.me data the
      # reviews section already reads, fit first then comfort or stretch.
      # Nothing is written or reworded here; with none, nothing renders.
      assign st_blob = ''
      assign st_n = 0
      assign st_pool = blank
      if collections.chinos != blank
        assign st_pool = collections.chinos.products
      endif
      for st_pass in (1..3)
        for st_p in st_pool
          assign st_d = st_p.metafields.judgeme.review_widget_data.value
          if st_d != blank and st_d.reviews != blank
            for st_r in st_d.reviews
              if st_n < 5 and st_r.verified_buyer and st_r.rating >= 4
                assign st_body = st_r.body | strip_html | strip
                assign st_key = st_body | downcase
                assign st_hit = false
                if st_pass == 1
                  if st_key contains 'fit'
                    assign st_hit = true
                  endif
                elsif st_pass == 2
                  if st_key contains 'comfort'
                    assign st_hit = true
                  endif
                  if st_key contains 'stretch'
                    assign st_hit = true
                  endif
                elsif st_r.rating == 5
                  assign st_hit = true
                endif
                if st_key contains 'hubby' or st_key contains 'husband'
                  assign st_hit = false
                endif
                if st_hit and st_body.size > 20 and st_body.size < 190
                  unless st_blob contains st_body
                    assign st_blob = st_blob | append: st_body | append: '~~' | append: st_r.reviewer_name | append: '||'
                    assign st_n = st_n | plus: 1
                  endunless
                endif
              endif
            endfor
          endif
        endfor
      endfor
      assign st_list = st_blob | split: '||'
    -%}
    {%- if st_list.size > 0 -%}
      <div class="gstone-voices" data-gstone-voices aria-label="Customer reviews">
        {%- for st_item in st_list -%}
          {%- assign st_parts = st_item | split: '~~' -%}
          <figure class="gstone-voice{% if forloop.first %} is-on{% endif %}" data-gstone-voice{% unless forloop.first %} aria-hidden="true"{% endunless %}>
            <blockquote class="gstone-voice__text">{{ st_parts[0] }}</blockquote>
            <figcaption class="gstone-voice__meta">
              <span>{{ st_parts[1] }}</span>
              <span class="gstone-voice__dot" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
              <span class="gstone-voice__verified">Verified purchase</span>
              <a class="gstone-voice__all" href="#guillo-reviews">Read all reviews</a>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        {%- endfor -%}
        {%- if st_list.size > 1 -%}
          <div class="gstone-voices__dots" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose a review">
            {%- for st_item in st_list -%}
              <button type="button" class="gstone-voices__dot{% if forloop.first %} is-on{% endif %}" data-gstone-dot="{{ forloop.index0 }}" role="tab" aria-selected="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" aria-label="Review {{ forloop.index }}"></button>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

{%- if section.settings.stone_scene_image != blank -%}
  {%- assign st_scene_pos = 'object-position:' | append: section.settings.stone_scene_position | default: 'center center' -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    One editorial moment: a full-width genuine Guillo campaign photograph and
    a single line. Where the chino belongs, not what it is made of. Lazy
    loaded; the product gallery above stays the page's LCP.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <figure class="gstone-scene">
    {{
      section.settings.stone_scene_image
      | image_url: width: 2400
      | image_tag: class: 'gstone-scene__img', widths: '750, 1100, 1600, 2000, 2400', sizes: '100vw', loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.stone_scene_alt, style: st_scene_pos
    }}
    {%- if section.settings.stone_scene_line != blank -%}
      <figcaption class="gstone-scene__cap">{{ section.settings.stone_scene_line }}</figcaption>
    {%- endif -%}
  </figure>
{%- endif -%}

<style>
  /* Stone test: the story band under the gallery and column. */
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 400px) minmax(0, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: 1fr auto auto auto auto 1fr;
    grid-template-areas:
      "media ."
      "media head"
      "media fit"
      "media feats"
      "media voices"
      "media .";
    column-gap: 72px;
    row-gap: 0;
    margin: 72px 40px 0;
    padding-top: 56px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--g-line);
  }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band__head { grid-area: head; align-self: end; }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band__media { grid-area: media; }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band__fit { grid-area: fit; margin: 0 0 30px; display: grid; gap: 22px; max-width: 460px; }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band__feats { grid-area: feats; max-width: 520px; }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band__voices { grid-area: voices; align-self: start; }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font: 500 10px/1 var(--g-sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--g-bronze);
  }
  /* The story is the one moment on this page that is allowed to be large. */
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band__title {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font: 400 clamp(32px, 3.4vw, 46px)/1.1 var(--g-serif);
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: var(--g-ink);
    max-width: 16ch;
  }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band__sub {
    margin: 0 0 38px;
    font: 300 17px/1.65 var(--g-sans);
    color: var(--g-muted);
    max-width: 40ch;
  }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band .guillo-pdp__video { margin: 0; }

  /* Fit gauges. */
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-fitbar__row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font: 500 10.5px/1 var(--g-sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--g-ink);
  }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-fitbar__val {
    font: 400 12px/1 var(--g-sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    text-transform: none;
    text-align: right;
    color: var(--g-muted);
  }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-fitbar__track { position: relative; height: 1px; background: var(--g-line); }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-fitbar__dot {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--g-ink);
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-fitbar__ends {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    font: 400 10px/1 var(--g-sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--g-muted);
  }

  /* Features: one closed row with a down arrow. Same hairline and label type
     as the fit gauges above it. Open, it shows icon rows. */
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-featgroup {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--g-line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--g-line);
  }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-featgroup__btn {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 16px 0;
    list-style: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font: 500 10.5px/1 var(--g-sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--g-ink);
  }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-featgroup__btn::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-featgroup__btn:focus-visible { outline: 1px solid var(--g-ink); outline-offset: 4px; }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-feat__mark {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: #A0A3A9;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-featgroup[open] .gstone-feat__mark { transform: rotate(180deg); color: var(--g-ink); }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-feats { border-top: 1px solid var(--g-line); }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-feat {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--g-line);
  }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-feat:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-feat__icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 19px;
    height: 19px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 1px;
    color: var(--g-ink);
  }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-feat__body { min-width: 0; }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-feat__label {
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    font: 400 13px/1.3 var(--g-sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--g-ink);
  }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-feat__text {
    margin: 0;
    font: 300 14px/1.65 var(--g-sans);
    color: var(--g-muted);
    max-width: 52ch;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-feat__mark { transition: none; }
  }

  /* One real review at a time, cycling. */
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band .gstone-voices { margin: 34px 0 0; display: grid; }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-voice {
    grid-area: 1 / 1;
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease;
  }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-voice.is-on { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band .gstone-voice__text { margin: 0 0 7px; font: 400 20px/1.4 var(--g-serif); color: var(--g-ink); }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-voice__meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    font: 400 11px/1.4 var(--g-sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--g-muted);
  }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-voice__verified { color: var(--g-bronze); }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-voice__all { margin-left: auto; color: var(--g-ink); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-voices__dots { grid-area: 2 / 1; display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-top: 12px; }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-voices__dot { width: 18px; height: 2px; padding: 0; border: 0; background: var(--g-line); cursor: pointer; }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-voices__dot.is-on { background: var(--g-ink); }

  /* Editorial scene: full width, one line, nothing else. */
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-scene {
    position: relative;
    margin: 72px 0 0;
    background: var(--g-canvas);
  }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-scene__img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(420px, 56vw, 720px);
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-scene__cap {
    position: absolute;
    left: 40px;
    bottom: 36px;
    max-width: 30ch;
    font: 400 15px/1.5 var(--g-sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: #fff;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 14px rgb(12 13 16 / 0.45);
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      grid-template-rows: auto;
      grid-template-areas: "fit" "feats" "head" "media" "voices";
      margin: 40px 20px 0;
      padding-top: 0;
      border-top: 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band__title,
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band__sub { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band__title { font-size: 30px; }
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band__sub { font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 26px; }
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band__fit { margin: 0 auto 30px; max-width: 320px; }
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band__feats { max-width: none; text-align: left; }
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-featgroup__btn { padding: 15px 0; }
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-feat { padding: 14px 0; }
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band__head { margin-top: 40px; }
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band__eyebrow { margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band__media { margin: 0; }
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band .gstone-voices { margin-top: 30px; }
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band .gstone-voice__meta { justify-content: center; }
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band .gstone-voice__all { margin-left: 0; }
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-band .gstone-voices__dots { justify-content: center; }
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-scene { margin-top: 48px; }
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-scene__img { height: auto; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; }
    .guillo-pdp--stone .gstone-scene__cap { left: 20px; right: 20px; bottom: 22px; font-size: 14px; }
  }
</style>
